                            <div class="answer-wrapper">
                                <img class="icon-qa-answer" src="/qna-microsite/static/images/qa-answer.svg" alt="answer" />
                                <div class="answer-body">
                                    <div class="answer__description">One of   the most dangerous threats to a seriously injured or ill person is   unnecessary movement. Moving an injured person can cause additional injury   and pain and may complicate his or her recovery. Generally, you should not   move an injured or ill person while giving care. <br /></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="answer-media">
                            </div>
